WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:08.340
We recently had some work done by Vlad and his team and as you can see they did a really nice job, very clean and professional.

2
00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:18.340
Originally in this particular spot we had some leakage under the stairs and when we took those stairs out we discovered some issues with the foundation.

3
00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:26.340
So Vlad and his guys did some underpinning and then installed the waterproofing and the sump pump.

4
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:37.340
And all through the process they kept us well informed of what was going on and how things were progressing and we were very very happy with the outcome.

5
00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:41.340
At this point I'd be happy to recommend them to do waterproofing for anybody.
